github.com/paullepoulpe/jsgo

This repository is a Go translation of Google Closure Compiler v20260415
(https://github.com/google/closure-compiler) and of the parts of Closure's
Java dependencies that the compiler uses. Each translated file is covered by
the licence of the work it translates. The full licence texts are in
LICENSES/.

The repository's original code (code that translates none of the works
below, such as the tools under tools/ and the Java library behaviour in
internal/jutil that is written from public specifications) is not yet
under any licence: its owner has not chosen one. This file grants no
licence for it.

A translated file names its source on its first line, either
"// Port of <path> ..." or "// Derived from <path> ...", and carries the
copyright and licence notice of that source after it.
"go run ./tools/licenses -check" (part of "make vet") enforces this for
the third-party projects below.


